ipped upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Increase Your &quot;Blob-Army&quot; And See How Many Waves You Can Survive</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/extras/Exbpand_and_survive.gif?t=1744650109\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Continue to play, grow, battle, and purchase new upgrades and see how many waves you can last.\u00a0 <br><br><i>A </i><i><u>Global</u></i><i> Leaderboard will display who\u00a0the best<strong>\u00a0AutoBlobber is</strong></i>.\u00a0 <br><br><strong>Will you be the best?</strong></p>","developers":["Pancake Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3240250/header.jpg?t=1744650109","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112923,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112923/movie480.mp4?t=1741697710","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112923/movie_max.mp4?t=1741697710"},"name":"Announcement","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112923/7b5a8c87e833b7c30451a6b90d2288ebc271608a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741697710","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112923/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741697710","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112923/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741697710"}}],"name":"AutoBlobber","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Rade